  "description": "If your mission is to flatten the hills and roll over rocky terrain effortlessly, the Flightline 29 Comp is ready for duty. Utilizing the FL3Gi frame and endowed with smooth welds and all the innovative geometry of the higher-priced Flightline models, the Comp delivers a quick, nimble ride uncommon for 29ers without leaving you penniless. Throw in a mix of high quality, value-packed Shimano Deore components, and the Flightline 29 Comp flattens more than just hills, it flattens the competition too.\nSR Suntour XCR 29, 100mm w/ hydraulic lock out\nShimano M522 Octalink crankset, 42/32/24, sealed cartridge BB\nShimano Deore front and rear derailleurs\nShimano HG-62, 10-speed, 11-34 cassette\nShimano Deore 10-speed shifters\nKenda Small Black Eight 26 x 2.10\" tires\nTektro Draco 2 brakeset",
